            "command": "\"H:/.claude/bin/portable-node\" H:/prism/.claude/hooks/posttool-rtk-adoption-measure.mjs",
            "timeout": 1500
          },
          {
            "_comment": "SLOT-HEARTBEAT-FIX (2026-05-27, slot:golf): wire chat-slot-heartbeat.mjs into PostToolUse:* so chats doing autonomous /loop work refresh their slot heartbeat on every tool call. WITHOUT THIS WIRING, chats running tool-heavy work between user prompts have NO heartbeat refresh path (heartbeat-keepalive.mjs is UserPromptSubmit-only). Their slot heartbeat ages out → fleet sees them as crashed → /checkin --force --confirmRecent reclaims their slot → operator-reported 'chats disconnected from their slots'. Observed pattern: 10-chat cluster bled out at ~8030s heartbeat-age, all simultaneously transitioned from interactive to autonomous work ~2.2h ago. The hook itself is 45s-debounced + lock-free read + fail-soft (existing on disk since SR-MS0 but never wired in settings.json). Disable: PRISM_HEARTBEAT_KEEPALIVE_DISABLE=1.",
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"H:/.claude/bin/portable-node\" H:/prism/.claude/hooks/chat-slot-heartbeat.mjs",
            "timeout": 2000
          },
          {
            "_comment": "PER-SLOT-CLOSED-LOOP-INTEGRATION/U-PSCL03 (2026-05-28, slot:alpha): outcome-bus-auto-tap (india #1 from PER-SLOT-SKILL-RECOMMENDATIONS-2026-05-28.json). PostToolUse auto-publishes every Edit/Write/Bash/MultiEdit/TodoWrite outcome into state/shared/outcome-bus.jsonl with {slot, domain, tool, success, hint}. Unlocks closed-loop learning for EVERY consumer slot (foxtrot/whiskey/mike/charlie/hotel/oscar/echo/delta/kilo/xray) per PER-SLOT-CLOSED-LOOP-INTEGRATION-2026-05-28.md universal template. Throttled 200ms per (slot, tool, success) tuple. Fail-soft (never blocks chain, never throws). Knobs: PRISM_OUTCOME_BUS_AUTO_TAP_{DISABLE,DRY_RUN,THROTTLE_MS}.",
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"H:/.claude/bin/portable-node\" H:/prism/.claude/hooks/outcome-bus-auto-tap.mjs",
            "timeout": 2000
          }
        ]
      },
